OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786371512
OL,3,CNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,4,CService declares major incident
OL,6,FA fire service has declared a major
OL,7,Fincident as two large fires in
OL,8,Fwoodland areas have put a strain on
OL,9,Fresources amid hot and dry weather
OL,10,Fconditions.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService declared a major incident at
OL,14,F1.30pm on Sunday while 14 crews tackle
OL,15,Ftwo separate fires near Mansfield.
OL,17,FA fire broke out at Strawberry Hill
OL,18,FHeath at about 2pm on Saturday, with
OL,19,F12 crews tackling the blaze at its
OL,20,Fheight, Nottinghamshire Fire and
OL,21,FRescue Service said.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
