FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786371512
OL,3,CNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,4,CService declares major incident
OL,6,FEight fire engines remain at the site,
OL,7,Fwhile six others and a water carrier
OL,8,Fhave been deployed to tackle a second
OL,9,Fblaze that broke out at Sherwood Pines
OL,10,Fon Sunday.
OL,12,FThe fire service said in a statement:
OL,13,F"As of 1.30 pm, Nottinghamshire Fire
OL,14,Fand Rescue Service has declared a
OL,15,Fmajor incident.
OL,17,F"This relates to the cumulative impact
OL,18,Fof multiple incidents placing
OL,19,Fsignificant pressure on operational
OL,20,Fresources, rather than a single
OL,21,Fincident in isolation.
OL,26,@uD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786371512
OL,3,CNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,4,CService declares major incident
OL,6,F"The service is currently operating
OL,7,Fwith very limited resources and
OL,8,Freduced pump availability.
OL,10,F"As a result, response times to any
OL,11,Ffurther incidents are likely to be
OL,12,Fdelayed."
OL,14,FPeople have been urged to avoid the
OL,15,Farea, and residents affected by the
OL,16,Fsmoke have been advised to keep their
OL,17,Fdoors and windows closed.
OL,19,F"Still call 999 in an emergency,"
OL,20,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,21,FService added.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUtD@IO]{D@AOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786371512
OL,3,CNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,4,CService declares major incident
OL,6,F"We would like to remind people not to
OL,7,Flight any fires, such as campfires or
OL,8,FBBQs, and to take extra care when
OL,9,Fdisposing of cigarettes due to the
OL,10,Fincredibly dry conditions, as a spark
OL,11,Fcould spread quickly."
OL,13,FAbout 36,000 square metres of woodland
OL,14,Fand undergrowth have been affected by
OL,15,Fthe blaze at Strawberry Hill Heath,
OL,16,Fand Nottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,17,FService said in an update on Sunday
OL,18,Fthat crews were expected to remain at
OL,19,Fthe scene "for several more hours".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@VO]{D@KOU{D@bO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/5
