PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786371512
OL,3,CNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,4,CService declares major incident
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,7,FService have 24 fire stations across
OL,8,Fthe county with 30 fire engines.
OL,10,FThis means nearly half of their fire
OL,11,Fappliances are currently attending the
OL,12,Fwildfire sites.
